{
 "duration": 26.278,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Leah rolled her ankle two miles from the car.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.694
  },
  {
   "text": "Her friend called for help, and they waited.",
   "start": 3.144,
   "end": 5.314
  },
  {
   "text": "Within minutes of stopping, Leah started to shiver.",
   "start": 5.764,
   "end": 8.33
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Put on every dry layer and a hat.",
   "start": 8.93,
   "end": 11.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Get off the cold ground, so sit on your pack.",
   "start": 12.35,
   "end": 14.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Then climb into an emergency bivy.",
   "start": 15.2,
   "end": 17.388
  },
  {
   "text": "It reflects your body heat back and blocks the wind.",
   "start": 17.788,
   "end": 20.427
  },
  {
   "text": "Leah was still warm when the rescue team reached them.",
   "start": 21.027,
   "end": 23.723
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next winter hike.",
   "start": 24.223,
   "end": 26.078
  }
 ],
